*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: ISO 8601 forms of dates and times that the specification does not allow: the basic format, a week date, an ordinal date, a decimal fraction, a time with only the hour and a time with the letter T in front. Each value is an error.

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 1
AA 20260705T0800Z/20260705T1000Z
AA 2026-W28-1T08:00Z/2026-187T10:00Z
AA 2026-07-08T08:00:00.5Z/2026-07-08T10Z
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E

